SUMMARY:YOGA IN NATURE™ at Apex Nature Park
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\nJoin us for a 60 minute slow vinyasa f
 low to yin yoga practice\, designed for beginners (to intermediate) Those 
 new to yoga WELCOME.\nThe yoga practice (breath and asana) is infused with
  a connection to nature in order to help calm the mind and energize the bo
 dy. Shade and sun options for your practice.\nYoga heals.\nNature heals.\n
 Cost is $15/person payable by cash\nOR Venmo @Darlene-Genander (0862 if as
 ked)\nOR PayPal dgenander@yogainnature.com\nAlso accepting payment with Ze
 lle\nBring your yoga mat\, water\, towel or plastic liner for under your m
 at (if you want to protect it from ground/wet) or anything else you may us
 e for your yoga practice.\nYou may also want to bring sunscreen and insect
  repellent.\nHope to see you soon!
