SUMMARY:"Women Together" Yoga & Wellness (Fall) Retreat
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**Early signups until September 30 wil
 l pay $115 for the day.** After that date\, the cost will be $130. We will
  come together again for another **"Women Together" Yoga & Wellness (Fall)
  Retreat with the theme *The Art of Letting Go. ***As we immerse ourselves
  in the fall season\, we learn from nature that it is okay to let go in or
 der to get ready for the next season. This day set with intention will off
 er you the opportunity to release what no longer serves you.\n\n* Vinyasa 
 flow yoga to yin practice (outdoors\, weather permitting with option for i
 ndoor practice)\n* Breathing and releasing\n* Nature connection and immers
 ion using all of our senses\n* Creative time\n* Use of fire pit for releas
 ing ceremony\n* Hot teas and snacks\n* Nourishing lunch\n* Gift bag for yo
 ur healing journey\n\nBring your yoga mat and wear layers. We will move fr
 om the indoors/outdoors throughout the day. Arrival at 9:45am and programm
 ing will be from 10am - 2pm with option to stay and settle in a bit longer
  (until 3pm) on the porch\, around the pond or inside the cabin in the coz
 y space.\n**Your payment is due when you sign up and holds your spot/ is y
 our ticket to the event.** Please pay by Venmo\n@Darlene-Genander (0862 if
  asked)\, by PayPal dgenander@yogainnature or accepting Zelle
